I was warned about Gussie.

1521
01:08:32,412 --> 01:08:33,648
I could have stopped it.

1522
01:08:33,781 --> 01:08:34,816
Do you still love me?

1523
01:08:37,417 --> 01:08:38,920
Did you sleep with her,
Frank?

1524
01:08:41,388 --> 01:08:42,824
Do you still love me?

