♪ <i>Not a day goes by</i> ♪

1526
01:08:50,665 --> 01:08:53,433
♪ <i>Not a single day</i> ♪

1527
01:08:55,469 --> 01:09:00,307
♪ <i>But you're somewhere</i>
<i>a part of my life</i> ♪

1528
