♪ <i>Not a day goes by</i> ♪

1539
01:09:36,944 --> 01:09:40,515
♪ <i>Not a blessed day</i> ♪

1540
01:09:43,450 --> 01:09:48,022
♪ <i>But you're still somehow</i>
<i>Part of my life</i> ♪

1541
