01:10:06,174 --> 01:10:08,475
♪ <i>After day after day</i> ♪

1546
01:10:08,609 --> 01:10:11,979
♪ <i>After day after day</i>
<i>after day</i> ♪

1547
01:10:13,047 --> 01:10:17,051
♪ <i>Till the days go by</i> ♪

1548
01:10:17,185 --> 01:10:22,056
♪ <i>Till the days go by</i> ♪

1549
01:10:22,190 --> 01:10:26,761
♪ <i>Till the days go by</i> ♪

1550
01:10:33,534 --> 01:10:35,536
