<i>can be slow</i> ♪

2209
01:37:00,689 --> 01:37:02,156
♪ <i>Darling</i> ♪

2210
01:37:02,289 --> 01:37:05,359
♪ <i>Take it easy as you</i> ♪

2211
01:37:05,492 --> 01:37:07,629
♪ <i>Climb</i> ♪

2212
01:37:07,762 --> 01:37:10,197
♪ <i>I'd say you're a winner</i> ♪

