2228
01:38:02,249 --> 01:38:03,551
It's not big on depth.

2229
01:38:03,685 --> 01:38:05,754
It's flash, bam, curtain.
It's fun!

2230
01:38:05,886 --> 01:38:06,855
It's opulent!

2231
01:38:06,987 --> 01:38:08,590
It's Broadway.

2232
01:38:08,723 --> 01:38:10,190
[LAUGHS] God.

2233
01:38:10,324 --> 01:38:11,659
Okay.

2234
