Oh, what was that?

2235
01:38:16,430 --> 01:38:18,165
-A second thought.
-Oh, no, no.

2236
01:38:18,298 --> 01:38:20,535
That's something I do when
I want to hold on to a moment.

2237
01:38:20,668 --> 01:38:23,270
I close my eyes very tight
and I swallow,

2238
