2633
01:54:53,227 --> 01:54:54,829
Do you?

2634
01:54:54,962 --> 01:54:59,868
[CHUCKLES SOFTLY]
Before, my reason was the baby.

2635
01:55:01,068 --> 01:55:02,936
But now my reason is you.

2636
01:55:11,011 --> 01:55:12,446
And my reason is you.

2637
01:55:12,580 --> 01:55:14,915
[LAUGHING]

