to do that, I play here.

2653
01:55:47,381 --> 01:55:48,817
I accompany singers
at auditions.

2654
01:55:48,949 --> 01:55:50,652
I play for dance classes.
I do arrangements.

2655
01:55:50,785 --> 01:55:53,788
